      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "To expand on it, some world creators like having the public avatar as a reward for a challenge (for example), so having a toggle such as \"searchable\" would be a good solution, if the team decides to implement this idea.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
