  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-06-29T22:17:13.996Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Since people can already make their avatars public it would be nice for a menu where you can see public avatars for you to try. A search bar to find a specific character or a list of the most popular avatars being tried on. It would be nice for new players to find a avatar they feel comfortable in easier rather than finding a avatar world that might have a avatar or character they want. Not to mention new players might not even know avatar worlds are a thing. It would be a nice feature that me and many other want.",
